eted":false,"locked":false,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","link":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","roughness":1,"groupIds":["HWb_VRvuY0DK3ttvXl-RR","7ZwOLOlHorlKdmQRAh2_g"],"startBinding":{"mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[1,0.50009999999999999],"elementId":"dvOvspC7QtBFzsznPZg2e"},"index":"aE","startArrowhead":null,"backgroundColor":"transparent","endBinding":{"mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[0,0.50009999999999999],"elementId":"BkZHNdUmYklBGNTRr5dw-"},"angle":0,"elbowed":false,"fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"version":156,"roundness":null,"type":"arrow","updated":1788429185184,"id":"QSuueDqGOgvuQNWWN62OH","x":1209.777198770817,"seed":118192127,"boundElements":[],"y":1793.2278471650345,"opacity":100,"height":3.6691552424503451,"points":[[0,0],[130.02426950981058,3.6691552424503451]],"width":130.02426950981058,"frameId":null,"strokeStyle":"solid","versionNonce":13650751},{"seed":208003025,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"1MCr2zxgWXc2yWYqNhRM7","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1788430244504,"locked":false,"text":"Submission service\n\n- First save the user submission with pending state (because we dont want to lose the user submission)\n- first fetches test cases related to that problem.\n- also fetch information related how to run that particular language (compite command, execute\/run command)\n- create a local temp file with the user code and then sping up a new process and run user code in that and evaluate against it\n\n- finally save the results in the db and then return the response to the user.\n\n\n\nProblems\n\n- Trusting user submissions blindly and executing it in our host machine.\n- user can abuse\/attack. Exhaust CPU, Memory and other resorces, they can compromise our system. THis can affect other users execution as well.","version":882,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"aI","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Submission service\n\n- First save the user submission with pending state (because we dont want to lose the user submission)\n- first fetches test cases related to that problem.\n- also fetch information related how to run that particular language (compite command, execute\/run command)\n- create a local temp file with the user code and then sping up a new process and run user code in that and evaluate against it\n\n- finally save the results in the db and then return the response to the user.\n\n\n\nProblems\n\n- Trusting user submissions blindly and executing it in our host machine.\n- user can abuse\/attack. Exhaust CPU, Memory and other resorces, they can compromise our system. THis can affect other users execution as well.","height":375,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1382357535,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":8,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":null,"x":545.5696977469222,"angle":0,"y":2019.0054680440339,"width":1573},{"seed":1513003569,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"p7DTEIZNmL_MhN_AeDX_s","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1788429029611,"locked":false,"text":"problems\n\n- id\n- title\n- description\n- constraints\n- difficult\n- published\n- …metadata \n\n\ntestcases\n\n- id\n- problem_id(FK)\n- input\n- expected_output\n- is_hidden\n\n- time_limit_ms\n- memory_limit_mb\n\n- ..metadata\n\nlanguages\n\n- id\n- name\n- version\n\n- compiler_command\n- runtime_command\n\n\nsubmissions\n- id\n- user_id\n- problem_id\n- langauge_id\n- source_code\n- status\n- error_message\n- …metadata\n\nsubmission_results\n- id\n- submission_id\n- test_case_id\n- status\n- execution_time_ms\n- memory_used_mb\n- actual_output\n- error_message\n","version":592,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"aJ","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"originalText":"problems\n\n- id\n- title\n- description\n- constraints\n- difficult\n- published\n- …metadata \n\n\ntestcases\n\n- id\n- problem_id(FK)\n- input\n- expected_output\n- is_hidden\n\n- time_limit_ms\n- memory_limit_mb\n\n- ..metadata\n\nlanguages\n\n- id\n- name\n- version\n\n- compiler_command\n- runtime_command\n\n\nsubmissions\n- id\n- user_id\n- problem_id\n- langauge_id\n- source_code\n- status\n- error_message\n- …metadata\n\nsubmission_results\n- id\n- submission_id\n- test_case_id\n- status\n- execution_time_ms\n- memory_used_mb\n- actual_output\n- error_message\n","height":1350,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":1340034719,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":8,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":null,"x":2460.2751447942264,"angle":0,"y":1520.2280011308808,"width":209},{"seed":885452433,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"aeugvcTvbB0_iKHC87-lR","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1788429114155,"locked":false,"text":"GET \/api\/v1\/problems\nGET \/api\/v1\/problems\/{problemId}\n\nPOST \/api\/v1\/submissions\nGET \/api\/v1\/submissions\/{submissionId}","version":128,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"aL","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"originalText":"GET \/api\/v1\/problems\nGET \/api\/v1\/problems\/{problemId}\n\nPOST \/api\/v1\/submissions\nGET \/api\/v1\/submissions\/{submissionId}","height":125,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":202218673,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":8,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":null,"x":3093.8106971759321,"angle":0,"y":1514.1136886410147,"width":418},{"seed":1288092095,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"F9NQ33K0yNHD4PpaEknTQ","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1788429496363,"locked":false,"text":"Solutions\n\n- execute user code in a isolated environment or container.\n- we can create a separate vm or create a docker container and execute code over there.\n","version":167,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"aN","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Solutions\n\n- execute user code in a isolated environment or container.\n- we can create a separate vm or create a docker container and execute code over there.\n","height":125,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":2038854271,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":8,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":null,"x":563.48340645685619,"angle":0,"y":2593.260980169307,"width":957},{"seed":361295583,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"jjMIw-aSiM9yR-bR25pGz","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"opacity":100,"verticalAlign":"top","updated":1788429963284,"locked":false,"text":"Problems\n- docker spin up cost 200-400ms\n- if 100 requests came at a time then most of time spent on creating the container itself and other sequests start piling up. and this goes on exponentially.\n\n\nSolution\n- Pre create a pool of containers already running, idle\n- pick from pool if available else create a new\n","version":350,"autoResize":true,"type":"text","backgroundColor":"transparent","index":"aO","roundness":null,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Problems\n- docker spin up cost 200-400ms\n- if 100 requests came at a time then most of time spent on creating the container itself and other sequests start piling up. and this goes on exponentially.\n\n\nSolution\n- Pre create a pool of containers already running, idle\n- pick from pool if available else create a new\n","height":225,"link":null,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","fillStyle":"solid","groupIds":[],"versionNonce":157965951,"textAlign":"left","fontFamily":8,"lineHeight":1.25,"frameId":null,"boundElements":null,"x":573.3024691852371,"angle":0,"y":2840.1402716257403,"width":1727},{"seed":99854079,"strokeStyle":"solid","id":"Qp2w0xOJ912H-oOC78B1q","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"isDeleted":false,"fontSize":20,"